{"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"KeyboardKit sometimes introduces new features or changes that may cause side-effects to important parts of the keyboard engine. Such changes are often introduces as a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperiment","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" that is disabled by default."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Developers can manually opt-in to enable individual experiments, to be able to try them out before they become enabled by default."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Experiments","text":"Experiments"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keyboard-specific experiments are defined by the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperiment","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enum. Active experiments are defined with the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperiment\/activeExperiments","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" property. All experiments that are not in this list have ended and have no longer any effect."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An active experiment must be enabled to have any effect. You can use "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperiment\/isEnabled","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to check if an experiment is enabled, and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperiment\/setIsEnabled(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to manually enable or disable experiments."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Context","text":"Context"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperimentContext","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" class has observable state that can be used to inspect a list of currently enabled experiments."}]},{"code":["struct MyView: View {","","    @StateObject private var context = KeyboardExperimentContext()","","    var body: some View {","        ...","    }","} "],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperimentContext","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" has functions like "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperimentContext\/enabledState(for:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperimentContext\/syncEnabledStateWithExperiments()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". This context is only used to observe the list of enabled experiments, and not used to modify it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unlike most other context classes, the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperimentContext","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is not injected into the view environment. You must set up an instance when you want to use one, or use the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperiment","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" type or the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperimentSettings","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" screen."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Settings","text":"Settings"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperiment","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" stores all experiment-specific enabled state in the main "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperimentSettings","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instance."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperimentSettings","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" type has settings & functions like "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperimentSettings\/active","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperimentSettings\/isEnabled(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperimentSettings\/setIsEnabled(_:_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" that are used by "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperiment","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Settings-Screen","text":"Settings Screen"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"KeyboardKit Pro unlocks a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardExperimentSettingsScreen","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" that can be used to enable and disable a